{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal","id":337752,"title":"Could a Dune Person Exalt as a Sidereal?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-11T22:38:10-08:00","id":337752,"title":"Could a Dune Person Exalt as a Sidereal?","content":"I've been really pondering over this question as of late, for my own personal character creation purposes. I really want a Dune Person as part of a duo of Sids I'm coming up with, but I'm unsure as to the chances of this ever really happening in creation, ESPECIALLY as I'm probably weakest on Sid lore (doing my reading up on it now!) and the sourcebooks are always a bit vague on just HOW separate the Dune People are considered from the rest of humanity (though I think that might be just that the Dune People themselves consider each other separate, which makes sense!).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>i don't know a hecking thing, my guy","edited":{"userid":4416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4416-heedra","user":"Heedra","date":". 12-12-2014, 02:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4416-heedra","name":"Heedra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T22:48:29-08:00","id":337776,"title":"","content":"Sure. Why not?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">In Honor of <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros\" target=\"_blank\">TGUEIROS<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.myidentitydoctor.com/image/cache/data/Website-Product-Photos/medical-awareness/Awareness-Tags/R1C/R1BR-A-Colon-Cancer-Awareness-Ribbon-Charm-216x153.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> N</a>ever Repeat the Dumbness</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1338-bvbpl","name":"BvBPL","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"250"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T22:56:04-08:00","id":337778,"title":"","content":"The only requirement for Exaltation is that the individual must have a human Hun/Po soul. This means that Dune People, Wyld Mutants, Beastmen, etc can all Exalt as they possess human souls. and therefore, are considered to be human.<br /> <br /> And, just to point out, Dune People are very much human by any definition - they just happen to be albino and eat human flesh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-11T23:00:27-08:00","id":337800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337778#post337778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The only requirement for Exaltation is that the individual must have a human Hun/Po soul. This means that Dune People, Wyld Mutants, Beastmen, etc can all Exalt as they possess human souls. and therefore, are considered to be human.<br /> <br /> And, just to point out, Dune People are very much human by any definition - they just happen to be albino and eat human flesh.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> True, I reread the source material just now and it was clear that it's they themselves who are the ones who consider themselves separate from humanity, which was what I thought was the case!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>i don't know a hecking thing, my guy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4416-heedra","name":"Heedra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T01:40:16-08:00","id":337885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337778#post337778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The only requirement for Exaltation is that the individual must have a human Hun/Po soul. This means that Dune People, Wyld Mutants, Beastmen, etc can all Exalt as they possess human souls. and therefore, are considered to be human.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel as though this reasoning is the wrong way around.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T02:03:48-08:00","id":337893,"title":"","content":"I ran a game with an Archzeki Sidereal. Good character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1165-hecaton","name":"Hecaton","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T04:33:24-08:00","id":337944,"title":"","content":"If you can exalt as one sort you can exalt as any other, and we already have a canon Dune Person infernal - Sulumor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T04:41:06-08:00","id":337947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337944#post337944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you can exalt as one sort you can exalt as any other, and we already have a canon Dune Person infernal - Sulumor.</div> </div> </div> </div>I keep forgetting that.<br /> <br /> Why have her be one of the Dune People if she is going to look and act nothing like a Dune Person?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/nesling/works/15673780-loch-ness-monster-on-vacation?c=409846-mixed&amp;p=throw-pillow\" target=\"_blank\">Loch Ness monsters. On vacation. On a pillow.</a><br /> <br /> <br /> My wife is on <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1Ngo336SKXWmoRnG3QWmhS\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/864-jutlander","name":"Jutlander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T04:53:44-08:00","id":337951,"title":"","content":"Well, she is an albino. Besides, what do you want? A chapter fiction where the Infernal circle murders a bunch of dudes and after they're all &quot;NO, Su put that knife and fork away right now. We do not have time for this.&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T05:02:04-08:00","id":337958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337951#post337951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, she is an albino. Besides, what do you want? A chapter fiction where the Infernal circle murders a bunch of dudes and after they're all &quot;NO, Su put that knife and fork away right now. We do not have time for this.&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>We need to get Jen on this. We must have a comic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T05:04:49-08:00","id":337959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337947#post337947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep forgetting that.<br /> Why have her be one of the Dune People if she is going to look and act nothing like a Dune Person?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because that way she at least feels a bit related to the Exalted world instead of just being a hellnun?<br /> Seriously, Sulumor does not feel like she's part of Creation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T05:09:51-08:00","id":337962,"title":"","content":"Her outfit is easily explained by her considering a loincloth to be formal-wear until quite recently. She doesn't really have a normal reference frame for that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T05:42:43-08:00","id":337996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337947#post337947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep forgetting that.<br /> <br /> Why have her be one of the Dune People if she is going to look and act nothing like a Dune Person?</div> </div> </div> </div>My favouite version of her has a very simple answer to that question.<br /> She would never have chosen to be a Dune Person and spent most of her early life being quietly fascinated by the world beyond the dunes, kind of like The Little Mermaid if Ariel had cultural expectations to lure any humans she met to a watery grave. Also if Ariel's view of surface people wasn't so much &quot;we shouldn't kill them&quot; so much as &quot;why don't we kill them and take their stuff?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T07:21:21-08:00","id":338052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jutlander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337947#post337947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why have her be one of the Dune People if she is going to look and act nothing like a Dune Person?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I mean... to the extent that we can infer anything about how she acts from the three or so comics and occasional art she's in.<br /> <br /> Although even then, a decent amount of that stuff has her ministering to people in what is clearly the South.<br /> <br /> Although, come to think of it...<br /> <br /> I'd never considered before how Manosque Cyan is about the only signature character who has the decency to have her appearances in comics actually work towards developing her character and goals as depicted in a focused character write-up. It's like &quot;hey, we'll write this character as having a beef against the Realm and also happily getting one over on its powerful folks as she works within its system to bring it down, <i>and then actually show her doing that stuff in the comics</i>&quot;. There's even a kind of little arc to it. Can you name me any other character who has something like that, rather than, at best, just dicking around in a manner vaguely illustrative of their character stereotype?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T07:27:09-08:00","id":338057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337996#post337996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> She would never have chosen to be a Dune Person and spent most of her early life being quietly fascinated by the world beyond the dunes, kind of like The Little Mermaid if Ariel had cultural expectations to lure any humans she met to a watery grave. Also if Ariel's view of surface people wasn't so much &quot;we shouldn't kill them&quot; so much as &quot;why don't we kill them and take their stuff?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>This reminds me of that character in Lands of Creation who was having herself modified in a manner to resemble Dragon Kings, with us explicitly told that they offense they would take at this would lead to them murdering her.<br /> <br /> I never really knew what to make of that bit; certainly it's an interesting idea, and possibly the kind of thing you'd expect to come up at times in the setting, but it just seemed so mean spirited. Like, maybe I don't remember it fully, but it still seemed to be written more in the sense that she was trying to resolve a kind of setting specific body dysmorphia issue rather than a shallow appropriation or something (which I'm not necessarily saying is any more worthy of contempt), but it still has to slip a little joke in there.<br /> <br /> I don't know, it just stood out to me a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T07:30:17-08:00","id":338059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=337996#post337996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My favouite version of her has a very simple answer to that question.<br /> She would never have chosen to be a Dune Person and spent most of her early life being quietly fascinated by the world beyond the dunes, kind of like The Little Mermaid if Ariel had cultural expectations to lure any humans she met to a watery grave. Also if Ariel's view of surface people wasn't so much &quot;we shouldn't kill them&quot; so much as &quot;why don't we kill them and take their stuff?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>WIth Ursula as the primordial offering Ariel power?<br /> <br /> Little Mermaid would be a lot more interesting to me and I'd watch the hell out of that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/723-talam","name":"Talam","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T07:46:15-08:00","id":338063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Talam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338059#post338059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">WIth Ursula as the primordial offering Ariel power?<br /> <br /> Little Mermaid would be a lot more interesting to me and I'd watch the hell out of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ursula is very obviously Kimbery's fetich.<br /> She doesn't have a canon fetich detailed, does she?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"ran