,"date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T21:22:40-08:00","id":338690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338517#post338517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Knew this was coming when I first saw the thread.<br /> <br /> Anyone know if there's any stillsuits in Exalted?</div> </div> </div> </div>I could see there being some in the First Age and Shogunate. Possibly a few deep-desert communities may have preserved the knowledge of how to make them into the Second Age...<br /> <br /> Would they have to be Artifacts or could they just be mundane devices? If Artifacts, would Artifact 1 (2 for an armored version) be too low a rating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T21:25:15-08:00","id":338691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BvBPL</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338491#post338491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course Dune people can be Exalted. Mua'dib, Jessica, Duncan Idaho, Alia, Liet-Kynes for example.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ugh, can't resist: Zenith, Joybringer, Fire Aspect, No Moon, and Heroic Mortal, respectively!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T21:28:19-08:00","id":338693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338690#post338690\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could see there being some in the First Age and Shogunate. Possibly a few deep-desert communities may have preserved the knowledge of how to make them into the Second Age...<br /> <br /> Would they have to be Artifacts or could they just be mundane devices? If Artifacts, would Artifact 1 (2 for an armored version) be too low a rating?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think in Creation they are definitely Artifacts. And thus I doubt new ones are being made, just old ones maintained.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T22:26:45-08:00","id":338725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338068#post338068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So naturally she resorts to a stripper outfit themed on a culture found, as far as we know, nowhere in Creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not in Creation as such, but in Malfeas and the Underworld, Gothic/Christian imagery is often associated with Yozi or Neverborn cults. Apparently <i>because</i> its so out of place; the developers feel that makes them seem more alien to Creation. Or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T23:53:28-08:00","id":338779,"title":"","content":"It's often associated with Underworld stuff (I think, for example, the Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible is possibly the only Bishop mentioned in the whole game-line).<br /> It never really gets brought up with Yozi cults though.<br /> Though of course, there's not actually that many Yozi cults detailed in Exalted. The Lintha family, the Salmalin, and the Seven-Stranded Vine are the only major ones really.<br /> <br /> Anyway, if the Yozi did use Christian imagery in their cults, then it probably should be played relatively straight rather than parodied with stripper nuns, because what's the point of parodying a religion that no one else knows much about?<br /> It'd be like if a British person wrote a scathing play parodying Taoism. Virtually no-one would get it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T00:47:16-08:00","id":338813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338068#post338068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So naturally she resorts to a stripper outfit themed in a culture found, as far as we know, nowhere in Creation.<br /> <br /> This train of reasoning never even made it to the tracks.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, unless the books go out of their way to mention something it doesn't exist? Creation is huge and there is also the possibility that her fashion style came from Malfeas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T01:21:21-08:00","id":338839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338779#post338779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyway, if the Yozi did use Christian imagery in their cults, then it probably should be played relatively straight rather than parodied with stripper nuns, because what's the point of parodying a religion that no one else knows much about?</div> </div> </div> </div>It <i>used</i> to be played straight, back before the war. Now the imagery has been twisted into a mockery of itself, much like the Yozis were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T02:31:31-08:00","id":338912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338779#post338779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's often associated with Underworld stuff (I think, for example, the Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible is possibly the only Bishop mentioned in the whole game-line).<br /> It never really gets brought up with Yozi cults though.<br /> Though of course, there's not actually that many Yozi cults detailed in Exalted. The Lintha family, the Salmalin, and the Seven-Stranded Vine are the only major ones really.<br /> <br /> Anyway, if the Yozi did use Christian imagery in their cults, then it probably should be played relatively straight rather than parodied with stripper nuns, because what's the point of parodying a religion that no one else knows much about?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there is cathedrals in Malfeas, and CC herself have some inspirations from the Abrahamic religions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T02:35:27-08:00","id":338913,"title":"","content":"Not to mention the Empyreal &quot;Totally Not God, Honest&quot; Chaos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T04:00:19-08:00","id":338924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338839#post338839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It <i>used</i> to be played straight, back before the war. Now the imagery has been twisted into a mockery of itself, much like the Yozis were.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm... I like that idea actually. It probably needs to be made a little more explicit though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T08:29:19-08:00","id":339066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Talam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338059#post338059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">WIth Ursula as the primordial offering Ariel power?</div> </div> </div> </div>I assume so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338063#post338063\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She doesn't have a canon fetich detailed, does she?</div> </div> </div> </div>According to the Ink Monkey Bones section of Eric Minton's blog it's Ululaya, the Scarlet Moon despite her not being Kimmycakes' first soul. I assume that has something to do with the first two ending up reviled.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bastet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=338481#post338481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sulumor wishes to obtain peace from a position of strength.<br /> Its just that currently the Dune People are predators, feared but not respected its only a matter of time before someone gets their act together and plans a successful cull. As such the only way forward is to get organised before faced with the prospect of extinction because by then it would be too late.<br /> Some consider her extreme views a form of cultural extinction. To continue the Little Mermaid analogy she ran King Triton through because she knew that her father could never accept her vision.</div> </div> </div> </div> I really want to watch that version of Litte Mermaid.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm sorry father you're part of the old ways and for the good of our people I can't let you stand in the way of our future&quot;<br /> &quot;Ariel, what are you doing!?&quot; she produces a knife, one of the many items from the surface that's caught her eye over the years but only recently knew what it was for since the Sea Witch had opened her mind to possibilities &quot;succeeding you&quot; she replied and thrust the knife with a heavy heart. <br /> <br /> The court fell into silence and Sebastian saw his moment, he had heard tales of the fate of his brothers and sisters on the surface world where being boiled alive and consumed was the fate that awaited them. He could not bear the thought of his own children suffering such a fate as he raised his voice in a cheer &quot;all hail Ariel, the visionary!&quot;<br /> <br /> Others soon joined in while others marked the passing of King Triton in silence. Time would tell if they were simply paying their respects or biding their time to strike. There would be interesting times ahead in the Court of Queen Ariel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:01:35-08:00","id":339117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=339066#post339066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I'm sorry father you're part of the old ways and for the good of our people I can't let you stand in the way of our future&quot;<br /> &quot;Ariel, what are you doing!?&quot; she produces a knife, one of the many items from the surface that's caught her eye over the years but only recently knew what it was for since the Sea Witch had opened her mind to possibilities &quot;succeeding you&quot; she replied and thrust the knife with a heavy heart.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;My daughter, on the day you were born/hatched, the very reefs of Atlantica sang out your name: Ariel~&quot;<br /> <br /> That sounds like an undisputedly -epic- movie.<br /> Part of me also really wants to take the above quote out of context and make it my signature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","user":"Kleptomania","date":". 12-13-2014, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:30:16-08:00","id":339143,"title":"","content":"Now I want to read about Exalted versions of Beauty &amp; the Beast, Aladdin and the Lion King!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:32:44-08:00","id":339146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=339143#post339143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I want to read about Exalted versions of Beauty &amp; the Beast, Aladdin and the Lion King!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the Lion King is the &quot;kid's animated version&quot; of Hamlet, so you got your horrible tragedy right there in the source material <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:33:36-08:00","id":339147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kleptomania</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/337752-could-a-dune-person-exalt-as-a-sidereal?p=339117#post339117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Part of me also really wants to take the above quote out of context and make it my signature.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not going to stop you.<br /> <br /> and apparently the madness is strong with me today<br /> <br /> Eric lay upon his back, his legs straddled by the woman\u2019s tail she was cold to the touch and wore nothing besides a brassiere of strategically placed shells but he dared not let his eyes linger there as he looked into the eyes of the beautiful woman who had spared him from drowning.<br /> \u201cYou\u2019re a bold one\u201d there was an unmistakable sternness to her voice that instinctively made him cower and refrain from further attempts at eye contact \u201cthank you\u2026\u201d he spluttered \u201cmy father will reward you greatly for my safe return\u201d she smiled and leaned in to inspect her prize \u201cyour father?\u201d<br /> <br /> Eric squirmed \u201cyes, my father the king\u2026\u201d Ariel scoffed \u201cthe king of a handful of islands?\u201d Prince Eric paused \u201c\u2026just the one actually\u201d \u201cthen he\u2019s nothing to me\u2026\u201d she turned her nose up \u201c\u2026but you don\u2019t have to be\u201d. The Prince knew instinctively that he was dealing with a being that had power over his life and death and chose his words with care \u201chow may I be of service?\u201d she smiled, that was a good sign wasn\u2019t it.<br /> <br /> \u201cI am seeking a consort and of the men I\u2019ve considered sparing from the ocean\u2019s depths since my coronation you are by far the most eligible candidate.\u201d She stroked his hair and directs his head out to the shore \u201cAs far as your eyes can see is mine, join me Prince and we can rule it together!\u201d<br /> Eric hesitated; he had known women to fawn over him hoping to be ornamental royalty that simply looked beautiful and produced heirs. It disgusted him he could never love such a woman and its inverse, the element of danger that came with it drew him in like a moth to flame.<br /> <br /> \u201cMy name is Eric. What is yours Empress of the Ocean?\u201d<br /> A pause, a word she had never encountered before \u201cExplain this word Empress to me, my beautiful Eric.\u201d<br /> He explained and it brought a smile to her face, the sea was much greater than any of these Empires.<br /> \u201cMy name is Ariel and our dynasty shall rule over both land and sea, take me in your arms my Prince of Two Worlds and we\u2019ll issue the terms of your father\u2019s surrender together.\u201d<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":7,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","user":"Lioness","date":". 12-13-2014, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:41:47-08:00","id":339158,"title":"","content":"I feel that she should have a bunch of sycophant demons in the background who first respond to the proceedings with wide grins and polite applause.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:48:32-08:00","id":339163,"title":"","content":"Alas an oversight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:51:45-08:00","id":339166,"title":"","content":"Part of your world..<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.p